Short:        PPC samples distributed with SCPPC patch
Author:       Steve Krueger
Uploader:     Adam Markiewicz <23user wp pl>
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: ppc-powerup

Here's a few programs that I have compiled with
the SAS/C PPC compiler. To run them, type:

runelf <programname> <arguments>

The source to all of these can be found on Aminet.

Since the SASC patches are labeled as freely redistributable,
I don't see any problem in uploading it to Aminet.

Please put a note in there that neither I nor SAS are
supporting it though.

Steve Krueger
